# ouroboros#193 (round 160): a number rebound to a compiled function. The
# observe tuple's entropy field read 0 (VAL_BUILTIN) where the VM's VAL_FN
# binding has 1.0. EigenScript PR #1092 makes a NAMED native function
# (the round-158 make_native_fn box) answer 1.0 like VAL_FN, so the tuple
# matches; a rebind to a real builtin stays 0 (control).
define h() as:
    return 1
x is 1
x is 2
x is h
print of observe of x
y is 1
y is 2
y is len
print of observe of y
